# SWARM unit: the cheap co-op horde body — health only. NO Component Force: no bubble, no shield
# battery, no GPU readbacks; friendly emitters instead burn it via the CPU bubble-radius check
# (GameStructureComponent::bubbleRadius) and it still strains them (EmitterDrain). Spawned in bulk
# by GameMatch's ambient scatter + wave director (spawnLooseUnit). ContactEvents feed projectile
# hit damage.
Prefab gameEnemySwarm
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.12 0.08
		Scale 0.35 0.5 0.35
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Capsule
		Radius 0.35
		HalfHeight 0.2
		Density 100
		Friction 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
		ShortName SWRM
		Team 1
		HealthMax 15
		EnergyMax 0
		ShieldOutput 0
		MoveSpeed 4.5
		Accel 25
		AttackRange 1.2
		AttackDps 5
		PlayerDps 8
		EmitterDrain 1
